   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Per-environment transit /28 is the only thing connected to the hub. AKS VNets reuse 100.64.0.0/16 and are never advertised. Private clusters, all egress forced through the hub. Validated PoC: westus3, Kubernetes 1.36, Azure Linux 3.",
