   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Why it works",
   "originalText": "Why it works",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "te98",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1142,
   "y": 138,
   "width": 306,
   "height": 195.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#000000",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 98,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 98,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "\u2022 Hub connections are whole-VNet:\n  connect only a /28 transit VNet\n\u2022 Peering is non-transitive: the AKS\n  range stays private and reusable\n\u2022 NVA SNAT: Nexus and on-prem only\n  see 172.x.0.x source addresses\n\u2022 Routable footprint: 3 \u00d7 /28 = 48 IPs\n  (vs ~3 \u00d7 336 if AKS were connected)\n\u2022 All AKS egress uses the NVA + hub;\n  internet exits only via the hub firewall\n\u2022 NVA probe fails if forwarding/SNAT\n  breaks, so the ILB drains that instance",
   "originalText": "\u2022 Hub connections are whole-VNet:\n  connect only a /28 transit VNet\n\u2022 Peering is non-transitive: the AKS\n  range stays private and reusable\n\u2022 NVA SNAT: Nexus and on-prem only\n  see 172.x.0.x source addresses\n\u2022 Routable footprint: 3 \u00d7 /28 = 48 IPs\n  (vs ~3 \u00d7 336 if AKS were connected)\n\u2022 All AKS egress uses the NVA + hub;\n  internet exits only via the hub firewall\n\u2022 NVA probe fails if forwarding/SNAT\n  breaks, so the ILB drains that instance",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
