   "text": "containerd verifies it via AKS custom CA trust (securityProfile.customCATrustCertificates, in the azapi create request)",
   "originalText": "containerd verifies it via AKS custom CA trust (securityProfile.customCATrustCertificates, in the azapi create request)",
