   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Gotcha: setting CA trust reimages the hosted system\nnodes, but NAP nodes that already exist are NOT\nmarked drifted and keep failing with x509.\nSet it at create time, or recycle NodeClaims\n(scripts/e2e-test.sh -x recycle-nodes).",
   "originalText": "Gotcha: setting CA trust reimages the hosted system\nnodes, but NAP nodes that already exist are NOT\nmarked drifted and keep failing with x509.\nSet it at create time, or recycle NodeClaims\n(scripts/e2e-test.sh -x recycle-nodes).",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "re127",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "te129",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 52,
   "y": 1120,
   "width": 1390,
   "height": 15.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#000000",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 129,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 129,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "PoC results (westus3, private clusters): pod pull over TLS 326 MB at 1.4\u20132.2 Gbps \u00b7 kubelet pull 342 MB in 12.5\u201313.2 s \u00b7 pod internet egress IP = hub firewall public IP \u00b7 before CA trust: ErrImagePull x509: certificate signed by unknown authority",
   "originalText": "PoC results (westus3, private clusters): pod pull over TLS 326 MB at 1.4\u20132.2 Gbps \u00b7 kubelet pull 342 MB in 12.5\u201313.2 s \u00b7 pod internet egress IP = hub firewall public IP \u00b7 before CA trust: ErrImagePull x509: certificate signed by unknown authority",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
